  "description": "These 2 Stocks Came Through A Screen of 4950 Tickers...And Whats Up With The Croissant?!",
  "body_html": "<p>These two tickers both have positive earnings, positive cashflow, and have demonstrated a lot of strength in the last few months of pullback. One of them has the classic volatility contraction pattern, the other, the “Croissant”. You trade for 18 years you start to notice patterns that form. This isn’t an official term, just what I see. </p><p>These 2 tickers …</p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
